Error [jet.WritableCliReceiver]: A CLI method receiver must be read-only
  --> tests/ui/cli_program_mutable_receiver.jet:3:16
    |
  3 |     reset: fn(&self) {}
    |                ^^^^
 Why: Shared root flags are parsed into one program value and command dispatch must not mutate that value.
 Fix: Change the receiver to read-only `self`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1347
